{"4611300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AudioLabs", "steam_appid": 4611300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AudioLabs is a real-time music visualizer built for VR, desktop, and live stage visuals. The visualization is fully automatic, but there is plenty of room to customize the look, behavior, and feel of the experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURE LIST</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Anything</strong>: Build playlists from your own music library, or capture audio live from any application, output device, or input device.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full VR Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Visualizers</strong>: Mix and match visualizers to get more dynamic interactions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>: Edit visualizer behavior, color, and overall look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presets</strong>: Save and share your custom-built visualizers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spout2 Support</strong>: Output to Resolume, OBS, or any Spout2-compatible pipeline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIDI &amp; Key Mapping</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AudioLabs is a real-time music visualizer built for VR, desktop, and live stage visuals. The visualization is fully automatic, but there is plenty of room to customize the look, behavior, and feel of the experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURE LIST</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Anything</strong>: Build playlists from your own music library, or capture audio live from any application, output device, or input device.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full VR Support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Visualizers</strong>: Mix and match visualizers to get more dynamic interactions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong>: Edit visualizer behavior, color, and overall look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presets</strong>: Save and share your custom-built visualizers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spout2 Support</strong>: Output to Resolume, OBS, or any Spout2-compatible pipeline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIDI &amp; Key Mapping</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "AudioLabs is a real-time music visualizer for desktop and VR. For casual listeners, streamers, and VJs.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Italian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4611300/6f302c4b3b3a9f10f3dc84e9f7230b2798552a3c/header.jpg?t=1787272658", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4611300/8cc48d97f312331cebae8de24b6d0410996c7b2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787272658", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4611300/8cc48d97f312331cebae8de24b6d0410996c7b2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787272658", "website": "https://audiolabs.dev/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 26<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Sto